# スライドの描画の速さ (design 11.11), for tools/ui_run.py: the links of 仮身サンプル
# shown as slides (their 機能付箋 set to スライド), each page turned with → and timed:
# the slide says how long the page took to draw (slide: drew N in US us), svcstat how
# many calls processes made meanwhile, hosttime how long from the key to the line.
# Twice over, the second time with what was read kept. No pass or fail but the lines.
# The slide of a process says too how many calls of the system each page took.
# the time of one round trip into the kernel, as the drawing in a process makes them
run /boot/SVCPROG.ELF 45 10000
expectin 60 svcprog: tvrtt fn_dra_txt width ns
apps 019a4370-3819-79a2-9758-881e1e0de90a basic-slide
hostmark
open 019a4370-3819-79a2-9758-881e1e0de90a
expectin 60 slide: drew 1 in
hosttime open 60000
svcstat
logmark
hostmark
key 4F
expectsince slide: drew 2 in
hosttime key1_2 60000
svcstat
logmark
hostmark
key 4F
expectsince slide: drew 3 in
hosttime key1_3 60000
svcstat
logmark
hostmark
key 4F
expectsince slide: drew 4 in
hosttime key1_4 60000
svcstat
logmark
hostmark
key 4F
expectsince slide: drew 5 in
hosttime key1_5 60000
svcstat
logmark
hostmark
key 4F
expectsince slide: drew 6 in
hosttime key1_6 60000
svcstat
logmark
hostmark
key 4F
expectsince slide: drew 7 in
hosttime key1_7 60000
svcstat
logmark
hostmark
key 4F
expectsince slide: drew 8 in
hosttime key1_8 60000
svcstat
logmark
key 4A
expectsince slide: drew 1 in
svcstat
logmark
hostmark
key 4F
expectsince slide: drew 2 in
hosttime key2_2 60000
svcstat
logmark
hostmark
key 4F
expectsince slide: drew 3 in
hosttime key2_3 60000
svcstat
logmark
hostmark
key 4F
expectsince slide: drew 4 in
hosttime key2_4 60000
svcstat
